WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:02.510
Cele para pon pon

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.300
It will soon be time for the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.580
Between the 10 members of the Dream Team and Friend All

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.780
the person who rings the bell will become the Princess of the Seasons.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.160
There can only be one. Isn't it exciting?

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.620
It's obviously gonna be me!

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.890
Just you watch,

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.980
when I become the Princess of the Seasons...

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:36.040
Queen Dorothy, here is the mixed okonomiyaki you ordered.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.650
It's lukewarm!

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.560
I can't eat this, make it again!

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.860
A-as you wish, Queen Dorothy.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.780
That's what I'll do!

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.110
She's losing it.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.280
If you have the free time to fantasize like that, get moving your body!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.560
Fine...

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.200
All aim to be the Princess of the Seasons!

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:08.350
I shall beat her, and become an even stronger devil!

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:10.950
And Mikan will become a stronger angel-nanon!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:50.980
Win,
the Spring Grand Prix!

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.810
Do it again!

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.030
Fine...

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.790
Where did your "capisce" go-pri?

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:00.720
Mirei...

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.930
Pri!

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:07.410
If I don't become the Princess of the Seasons, then I can't stop Hibiki-san, right?

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:08.520
Pri.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.330
I wonder if I'm capable of it...

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.580
Hibiki is a lot older than us, and

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.580
always looks like this.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.200
I understand she was a good person before all this

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.880
but I think there's another way to fix things.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.020
I wonder if we could become friends...

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.380
Lala.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.250
We've leveled up a lot recently-pri.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:45.600
It's frustrating, but it's all thanks to her-pri.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.190
Mirei.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:50.340
So now, it's our turn.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:53.570
We definitely won't let Hibiki-san become a vocal doll-pri!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.630
And I will definitely become the Princess of the Seasons!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:12.230
It's my first time practicing with everyone, so much fun!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.730
I shall become the Princess of the Seasons!

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.730
I will win, and prevent Shikyouin-dono from becoming a Vocal Doll!

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:22.520
Problem solved!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.370
If I can stop Hibiki-san...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.870
Psshhuuuuu...

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:32.490
If there's even the smallest thing I can do,

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.780
I want to help Hibiki-san.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.990
I'm the strongest and the most talented, so I will win!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.110
There's only one person suited to be

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:44.960
the Princess of the Seasons!

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.350
And so, my dream will come true!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:57.310
The opposition is coming at us hard this time

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:01.250
If a prodigy trains, we don't stand much of a chance.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.370
I'm taking stomach medicine...

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.990
They understand...

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:10.900
that they can't win on talent alone this time.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:20.550
I'm fine, I'm giving it my all.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.140
Good night Garuru

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.290
Maho?

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.280
Wings that cover the sky.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:42.450
Their spread beckons darkness, a daisy.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.420
My name is the Phantom Natural

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.080
Flowers blooming in the field!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:50.470
You..

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:57.670
Midorikaze Fuwari, have you come to play?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.240
I want to know how you feel.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.990
How I feel?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.340
About Hibiki-san becoming a Vocal Doll

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.930
Do you think it's good for her?

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:13.980
If Maho became a Vocal Doll,

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.330
I could make a friend who I could be with all the time.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.230
That would make me happy!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.150
Daisys,

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.960
they bloom plentifully in my hometown in the Palps.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.910
Even in the Palps?

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.350
I want to show them to you.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:38.360
All the lovely flowers, blooming free in the Palps.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.770
All just as beautiful as yours.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.370
Think naturally.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.660
Speak to Tori too!

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.080
It's finally come.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.570
Make me some iced tea, Ando.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:07.800
Ah,

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.780
he's not here...

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.590
Give it your all, Onee-chan!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.650
Just for today,

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:18.410
I'll support you with the vim I give Falulu-sama!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:21.170
Thanks, I will Non!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:26.500
TL Note: Pun
With the cutlet sandwich and tortilla you had for breakfast, you should win!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:30.610
Don't push yourself too hard just do your best!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.430
Capisce, thanks!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.220
A lot has happened,
but we'll be going head to head today-pri!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:57.030
I feel the same way, I won't hold back!

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.560
I can already see you all crying after I win!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.840
I won't lose either!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.930
Aroma Prophecy 1111.

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:09.750
Destroy the fake demons
and become the Great Demon-dearu!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.720
I will win together win Aroma-nano!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.960
I'll dance my best!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.900
Fierce Fighting!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.090
With complete devotion, I shall ring the bell!

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.780
Lala is my friend, and now rival.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:27.820
Let's compete with everything we have!

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:30.960
I won't let you win!

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:35.150
Scan the MyTickets required for your cord

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:38.160
You can scan you Friend Tickets too.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.740
Cord Change Start!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.530
Departing on a world trip as a hitchiker.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.910
Come back with plenty of memories in your backpack!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.270
Hitch Hike Drive cord!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.970
For celebrities going on vacation, it's all about the jet.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.380
Your shoes are tyres and there's wings on your back!

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.750
Gracious Jet Cord!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.590
Hibiki-san...

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:21.560
Lala!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:25.690
Win! Don't let Curly-chan ring the bell-daVinci!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:28.330
Give it your all, everyone.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.780
Hibiki-sama...

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.820
Thank you for waiting,

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:39.640
the concert for the Dream Parade Princess Cord is starting!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.950
The Dream Parade Princess Cord.

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:46.920
Only the Idol who wins this,

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.810
can ring the Miracle Bell during a dream concert

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:56.640
These ten idols, who have competed and grown together,

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.230
have nothing left to say!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:05.120
They will all shine with everything they've got!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:09.710
Dream Theatre Live, switch on!

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.660
Airy Change!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:38.180
Airy Change!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.640
Gold Airy!

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.960
Gold Airy!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.670
The chord isn't shining!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:53.030
That's the Spring Cord, why isn't it shining?

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:56.530
Nobody has rang the bell, the battle isn't over!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.100
My dreams are getting closer!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.530
I'll end this with one fell swoop!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:23.530
I won't let you-pri!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.300
Lighting speed! The cord is mine!

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.560
Tension...

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.960
Max!

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.240
Relax!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.770
It would be best for you to move!

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.480
I will become the Princess of the Seasons!

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:41.370
Nobody's keeping up with me.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.690
Not so fast!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.410
Sophie...

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.870
I want to see you at your full potential.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.610
They're all so high, we've gotta catch up!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.140
What's up Falulu? You don't look well.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.220
Lala, what should I do?

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:07.010
I've heard the daises in the Palps are beautiful!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:08.700
Falulu...

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.850
Amazing! But...

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.740
Psshuuuu...

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.620
Wait!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.040
I will be the first one to ring the bell-pri!

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.660
Haven't you learned your lesson, are you trying to defeat me!?

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.890
No, this is a revolution-pri!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.420
You're still saying that?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:36.230
We'll take PriPara back from you, Hibiki-san-pri!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.750
I won't let you interfere!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:40.360
A trivial opponent!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.730
You are amazing,

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.080
I'm so happy to have had you as a rival!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.340
Me too!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:13:59.260
But...

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:04.610
The Princess of the Seasons shall be mine!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.220
I've got some unfinished business to take care of!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.590
Shion!

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:13.980
I'm fine,

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.970
I've got to stop her!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:17.350
Shion!

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.600
I can't let her out of my sight!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:24.820
Shion, you really...

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.230
Let's go, Falulu!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.260
I shall become a Great Angel-nanon!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.080
And me the Great Demon!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.630
Devi, devi devi devi!

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.900
As expected of you, Shiratama Mikan.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.600
Wait Hibiki!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.920
Get back here, tension max!

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.100
Relax!

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.930
I really am surprised.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:53.580
To make it this far, you've all allowed me to enjoy a splendid performance.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:56.960
Wait!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.770
They're just like juniors
aspiring to reach the same heights at me.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.050
I may just have fallen in love with you all.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.870
But... it's all an illusion!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.970
Airy Change!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.910
Platinum Airy!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:26.840
That was...

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.180
I'm shocked!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.470
What's going on!?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.490
It's the legendary Platinum Airy!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:33.420
Mikan, overtake her-devi!

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:37.460
Hey! I gave you 50 nikuman before this didn't I!?

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.240
Get back here!

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.700
Only I was blessed with such talent!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:45.600
It's my miracle!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.950
Platinum Airy...

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:53.300
I expect no less of you, Princess Falulu!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.560
Now, let us soar higher!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.290
What are you...!?

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.900
Maho-chan, you can't become a Vocal Doll!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.070
The daises in the Palps are beautiful!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.590
So beautiful...

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.390
You can't become a Vocal Doll!

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.660
Let's have this conversation later.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.770
Let's do it after my wish has been granted.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.320
Maho-chan...

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:37.860
Falulu!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.760
Lala, stop Maho-chan!

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:42.860
Falulu.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.440
I have decided, I want you to stop Maho-chan!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.680
Maho is my friend as she is right now!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.200
Please!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.020
Falulu...

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:54.840
I understand!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.390
Lala, take care of it-pri!

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.260
There she goes!

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:07.830
Falulu is my friend,
any friend of hers is a friend of mine!

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:08.500
And so...

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.390
She's still in Gold Airy!?

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.650
Hibiki-san, wait!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:18.970
I won't let anything sad happen in PriPara!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.350
I don't want anyone to regret anything!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.870
Even you Hibiki-san!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.690
Why are you so persistent!?

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:27.560
Because...

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.460
Get lost!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.620
Everyone, join hands-pri!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:50.770
Lala!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:58.470
Go, Lala!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.930
Capisce!

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:08.100
Because you are my friend, Hibiki-san!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:14.960
Because we're all friends, we're all idols!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.730
Final Airy!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:26.950
Da Vinci!?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.800
A Final Airy!?

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:36.450
Final Airy!?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.650
It can't be...

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.100
I'll protect PriPara!

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.770
No, I will!

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:54.200
Final stage, the world of lies is over!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:57.530
We're all friends, all idols!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.260
What!?

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:21.380
Cyalume Change!

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:25.910
Everyone put your wishes in to the bell!

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.870
We all want the same thing!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.330
Go!

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:38.850
Charm Bell!

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.380
They won!

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.010
Friendship prevailed!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:01.930
Maho-chan...

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.020
Hibiki-san...

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:10.310
My glasses, they're back!

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.300
Maho-chan.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.200
Friendship won? ...impossible.

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.470
I won't accept this!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.110
Friendship doesn't exist!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.550
What's happening!?

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:36.430
The system has begun to self-destruct!
